  "solution": {
    "text": "If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> members and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> has <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> members, then&nbsp;<br /><math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2016</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo><mn>63</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math><br />The number of members in&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math>"
